        Mammo-FM: Breast-specific foundational <span class="search-hit mathjax">model</span> for Integrated Mammographic Diagnosis, Prognosis, and Reporting
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Ghosh%2C+S">Shantanu Ghosh</a>, 
      
